{
 "esm": "1.2.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "template_array_args_coupled_template",
  "description": "The coupled case of esm-spec \u00a79.6.11, in the template form: `linear` and `bilinear` from lib/interp.esm. Phys declares `lev`, `T` and `cos_sza` scalar; the couplings bind Grid's [x, y, z] arrays to them, so every lookup is per cell."
 },
